§§ `ss 10, 18, 19, 37(3) -- a primary victim's amount`

-- Arguments: counselling, medical, lost earnings, clothing, safety, other recovery, exceptional, maximum in force, earnings
-- maximum in force, damages received, insurance received, likely payments counted, likely insurance counted, interim paid.
-- 2000 + 5000 + 20000 (25000 capped, s 10(2)(c)) + 300 + 1200 = 28500; the 4000 other only in exceptional circumstances.
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 2000 5000 25000 300 1200 4000 FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 28500
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 2000 5000 25000 300 1200 4000 TRUE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 32500
-- The loss of earnings cap at 19999, 20000 and 20001.
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 2000 5000 19999 300 1200 0 FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 28499
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 2000 5000 20000 300 1200 0 FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 28500
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 2000 5000 20001 300 1200 0 FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 28500
-- An indexed loss of earnings maximum of 21000: 2000 + 5000 + 21000 + 300 + 1200 = 29500.
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 2000 5000 25000 300 1200 0 FALSE 0 21000 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 29500
-- The $60 000 cap: 60000 exactly, 60001 capped, 70000 capped; an indexed maximum of 63000.
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 10000 30000 20000 0 0 0 FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 60000
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 10000 30001 20000 0 0 0 FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 60000
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 10000 40000 20000 0 0 0 FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 60000
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 10000 40000 20000 0 0 0 FALSE 63000 0 0 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 63000
-- s 18 after the cap (fork F4): 60000 - 5000 damages = 55000; - 3000 insurance - 2000 interim = 55000; - 1000 - 1500 = 57500.
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 10000 40000 20000 0 0 0 FALSE 0 0 5000 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 55000
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 10000 40000 20000 0 0 0 FALSE 0 0 0 3000 0 0 2000 EQUALS 55000
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 10000 40000 20000 0 0 0 FALSE 0 0 0 0 1000 1500 0 EQUALS 57500
-- Never below zero.
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 2000 5000 0 0 0 0 FALSE 0 0 70000 0 0 0 0 EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `How much can I be paid as a primary victim` 2000 5000 0 0 0 0 FALSE 0 0 0 0 0 0 9000 EQUALS 0

