#ASSERT `Can my application be decided` `a primary victim` (`d` 10 3 2025) (`d` 10 3 2025) (`d` 1 6 2010) FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 1 2060) FALSE EQUALS `yes: it is in time (s 23)`
