#ASSERT `Can my application be decided` `a related victim` (`d` 10 3 2025) (`d` 20 5 2025) (`d` 1 1 1990) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE (`d` 21 5 2028) FALSE EQUALS `no: it is out of time and the scheme decision maker does not consider it appropriate to decide it (ss 23, 24)`

§§ `s 23 -- the deadline rule run directly`

GIVEN `the days allowed` IS A NUMBER, `the day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `applied in time with` `the days allowed` `days, on day` `the day` IF
    CONSIDER EVALTRACE (`s 23 -- apply within the time` `the days allowed`) 0 (LIST (EVENT `the applicant` `apply for assistance` `the day`))
    WHEN FULFILLED THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE FALSE

-- 10 March 2025 to 10 March 2028 is 1096 days (2028 holds 29 February).
#ASSERT `the days from` (`d` 10 3 2025) `to` (`d` 10 3 2028) EQUALS 1096
#ASSERT `applied in time with` 1096 `days, on day` 1096
#ASSERT NOT (`applied in time with` 1096 `days, on day` 1097)
#ASSERT `applied in time with` 1096 `days, on day` 0

